\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  The followers of Christ walk through great faith.
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 It is a battle of great dedication,
\par It is a spiritual will, not of flesh,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Because spiritual needs
\par Run counter to flesh
\par And he that loathes things that are worldly,
\par forever lives.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Our journey leads through the toils of this earth,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 Before we get out of the battle victors.
\par When one embraces the joys of the world.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par And thinks highly of the vanities therein,
\par Such a person shall surely lose his soul,
\par And so get lost.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Strengthen thyself in the battle of sin,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 For should thou be relaxed sin shall control thee.
\par  Therefore strive zealously and fight forward.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par For your master has won victory already
\par And has thus won His crown of victory
\par Arise and fight.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  The fight is difficult and not easy,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0  Therefore with faith fight on for life eternal
\par This is your objective for serving Christ,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par But the pow'r to fight on is from God alone.
\par It is He that shall provide sustenance
\par \pard     Throughout your fight.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

